    "label": "List the videos a site plays",
    "job": "List video files, streams and frame addresses across a public site",
    "description": "Source-first port of the original site-media crawler. Opens at most 25 same-origin pages in Chromium, scrolls each ten times, records video requests and video/source/iframe addresses. Returns unique video addresses, visited pages and pages left by the bound. Does not sign in. Frames are reported as addresses, without claiming every frame is a player.",
